      "response_text": "A swarm of Asian carp attacked the Washington University rowing team's boat at Creve Coeur Lake, leaving team members in a state of terror with the fish flopping on their legs and a strong fishy smell lingering afterward.",
      "role": "online",
      "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:d64d3a6f4b9cdfd5c8b716e3525cbb5f2ff8084fce20c92524cb7e26e26ebd35",
      "sealed_prompt_token_count": 263,
      "sentence_count": null,
